        "created_at": "2015-04-19T15:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cool - There is another complication as some of the heroes/villains may appear earlier in the storyline than their expansion becomes available if I recall. To be honest, if that is the case, then I'd sooner not see it until the app gets close to the VIllains Of The Multiverse expansion (maybe as a primer for the final expansion(s)) or at least until you can get a long way in the story before you have to wait for another expansion<br><br>EDIT: Typo</p>",
